            "review_title": "Review at Cong ty CP Thuy Ta",
            "review_text": "cteague1\nLondon, United Kingdom1865 contributions\n2\nPleasant enough\nNov 2019 • Couples\nThis review refers to the establishment upstairs, not the cafe downstairs in the same location and street number which some reviewers have confused this place with.\nDinner here is not bad. The menu is like a phone book with a huge choice. Food is ok, nothing spectacular and fairly reasonably priced, but portions are quite small. That suits us in the evening, but many would object and feel it is poor value. About a million VND for 4 beers and a few courses each.\nRead more\nWritten November 15, 2019",
