            "review_text": "Terry Anzur\nJupiter, Florida1887 contributions\n1\nBreezy “Burger” Surprise\nJun 2018 • Solo\nThis lakeside place was mostly filled with locals enjoying drinks or an elaborate ice cream dessert. They also have a small food menu. The Tiger beer on draft was rather small and I got a surprise when I ordered the “vegetable burger.” It was a delicious soft bun with veggies in it - tomatoes, cucumber and onion but no burger patty! I guess veggie burgers aren’t a thing here. Came with tasty fries and a soft breeze on a steamy night in Hanoi. Stick to the ice cream menu and enjoy the view. No complaints about the service and they opened the patio umbrellas when it started to rain. Pleasant spot for a solo traveler.\nRead more\nWritten June 25, 2018",
