            "review_text": "sassiecat2015\nLondon, United Kingdom227 contributions\n0\nDon't be tempted by the view overlooking the lake.... thats all it has! Don't eat there\nDec 2017 • Couples\nWhen walking around the lake this cafe/restaurant looks the perfect spot. Overlooks the lake and has outdoor and indoor restaurant areas. Thats it Im afraid. The only other plus was that the beers were cold. The food choices are limited and range from baguettes sandwiches pizza and some Vietnamese dishes. The service is extremely slow even though the staff are very friendly. Food was cold when it got to us and bland. No attempt to make it look anything on the plate either. Not the best experience and if you look around that area there are lots of better options. Give it a miss even if you are starving.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 8, 2017",
